Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-prefs
Description: Speech-to-text overlay for GNOME Shell
 Press a hotkey, speak, and the transcribed text is typed into the
 previously focused window. Uses Whisper.cpp for on-device speech
 recognition and a GNOME Shell extension for text injection.
 .
 Features:
  * Real-time streaming transcription
  * Editable text area with word wrap
  * Auto-enter support
  * Dark themed overlay
  * No external typing tools required
